# The committed bundle: 2.7MB of minified output rewritten by every release. `-diff` stops a
# rebuild rendering as an unreadable wall of it, and linguist-generated stops GitHub reporting
# generated output as what this repository is written in.
dist/** -diff linguist-generated

# Per-package tsc output. Committed, but not source: lexicon reads this attribute to decide what
# auto-tracks, so without it the indexer treats emitted `.js` and `.d.ts` as the project's own code.
*/dist/** -diff linguist-generated
*/*/dist/** -diff linguist-generated
